  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A solid sphere of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is making pure rolling on a horizontal surface with kinetic energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2240</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>. The velocity of centre of mass of the sphere will be ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let velocity of centre of mass of sphere be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>.</p><p>Total kinetic energy of solid sphere is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;moment of inertia of the solid sphere about the axis passing through it&#39;s&nbsp;centre of mass and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mtext>pure&#160;rolling&#160;condition</mtext></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Therefore,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2240</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>v</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2240</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>",
